<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rand Mines' S.Africa JSE listing suspended.</title>
<headline>Rand Mines' S.Africa JSE listing suspended.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Rand Mines Ltd have been suspended with immediate effect following a request from the group's directors, the Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The JSE said in a statement shares would remain suspended pending an announcment relating to a court decision which may have a material effect on the company's share price.</p>
<p>Rand Mines intends to publish such an announcement on Friday, the JSE said.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
